This license covers the source code of this repository.

Generated and third-party assets carry their own terms:

- **Narration audio** (`public/audio/narration/`) was generated with ElevenLabs
  under a paid plan, which grants the account holder rights in the output.
- **Music** (`public/audio/`) was generated with Google Lyria 3 Clip and
  Lyria 3 Pro on Vertex AI. Google asserts no ownership of generated output.
  The files carry SynthID and C2PA provenance marks.
- **Lunar imagery** (`src/assets/lunar/`) is from NASA's CGI Moon Kit,
  Scientific Visualization Studio, used unmodified.

Redistributing these assets outside this project is not covered by the MIT
grant above; check the originating service's terms first.
